#: ../../source/references_autoreason-methodology.md:233
msgid ""
"**Practical rule**: As model costs drop and capabilities improve, today's"
" frontier becomes tomorrow's mid-tier. The generation-evaluation gap is "
"structural, not temporary. Match refinement architecture to the model's "
"position on the capability curve."
msgstr ""

